$DATUM tert-Butyl
2-(5-(6-bromo-4-methoxy-1-(triisopropylsilyl)-1H-indol-3-yl)-4-iodooxazol-2-yl)-1H-pyrrole-1-carboxylate
(16) To a suspension of 15 (240 mg, 0.34 mmol), N-Boc-pyrrole-2-boronic
acid (144 mg, 0.68 mmol), Cs2CO3 (334 mg, 1.03 mmol) in 1,4-dioxane (4
mL) and H2O (1 mL), Pd(dppf)Cl2·CH2Cl2 complex (14 mg, 0.017 mmol) was
added and the resulting solution degassed with argon for 10 min and
stirred at rt for 48 h. The reaction mixture was concentrated in vacuo at
20°C, diluted with EtOAc and water. The organic layer was separated,
washed with brine, dried (MgSO4), concentrated and the residue obtained
was purified by column chromatography (3→7% EtOAc in hexane). 16 (155 mg,
61%) as light yellow solid. Charred at 156-158°C, R f = 0.45
(Hexane/EtOAc 9:1). 1H NMR (CDCl3, 600 MHz): δ 7.46 (s, 1H), 7.43 (dd, J
= 3.3, 1.7, 1H), 7.27 (d, J = 1.3 , 1H), 6.75 (dd, J = 3.5, 1.7 , 1H),
6.70 (d, J = 1.3 , 1H), 6.28 (t, J = 3.4, 1H), 3.78 (s, 3H), 1.68,
(sept., J = 7.5 , 3H), 1.41 (s, 9H), 1.17 (d, J = 7.5 , 18H). 13C NMR
(CDCl3, 151 MHz): δ 155.4, 153.0, 147.9, 147.6, 142.0, 132.0, 123.8,
119.6, 117.8, 117.4, 115.6, 110.0, 109.4, 104.6, 103.7, 83.9, 80.7, 54.7,
26.8, 17.2, 11.9. HRMS (ESI): m/z [M+H]+ Calcd. for C30H40BrIN3O4Si:
740.1016; found: 740.1012.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM other products also detected (deiodinated of C2 of oxazole), Suzuki
coupling
