$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 5-Fluoro-6-(2-fluoropyridin-3-yl)-2-methylpyrimidine-4-amine (71c). A
mixture of 2-fluoropyridin-3-ylboronic acid (666 mg, 4.73 mmol), 65c (509
mg, 3.15 mmol), Na2CO3·H2O (835 mg, 7.89 mmol), and Pd(PPh3)4 (364 mg,
0.32 mmol) in DME (6 mL) and H2O (0.6 mL) was heated at 100 °C for 60 min
in a microwave reactor. The mixture was diluted with H2O (100 mL), and
the precipitate was collected by filtration, washing with CH2Cl2, to give
71c. Yield (418 mg, 60%), off white powder. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ
8.39 (d, J = 4.02 Hz, 1H), 8.18 (t, J = 8.03 Hz, 1H), 7.53 (t, J = 5.27
Hz, 1H), 7.38 (br s, 2H), 2.37 (s, 3H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM microwave irradiation, Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Structure-Based Design of a Novel Series of Potent, Selective Inhibitors
of the Class I Phosphatidylinositol 3-Kinases
