Timothy P. C.; Tumber, Anthony; Yapp, Clarence; Filippakopoulos, Panagis;
Bunnage, Mark E.; Muller, Susanne; Knapp, Stefan; Schofield, Christopher
J.; Brennan, Paul E.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2014), 136(26), 9308-9319

