125.1, 125.5 (q, J = 4.4 Hz), 127.1, 127.7, 129.1, 131.2 (q, J = 32.3
Hz), 131.9, 132.8, 136.1, 142.9, 147.4, 159.4. HRMS (El): M+, 400.0857;
calcd. for C21H15F3N2OS : 400.0857.
